<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n11013" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀξί̄ν-η</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>axe-head,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀξίνην ἐΰχαλκον ἐλαΐνῳ ἀμφὶ
					πελέκκῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					13.612
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>battle-axe</i> (expl. as <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δίστομος
				πέλεκυς</span> by <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>), ib.<i><span class="en">
				15.711
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				7.64
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>axe</i> for hewing wood, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>An.</u>
				1.5.12
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ev.Matt.</u>
				3.10
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ev.Luc.</u>
				3.9
			</span></i>. (Cf. Goth. <i>aqizi,</i> O<i><span class="en">
				E.
			</span></i>
			<i>æx,</i> Lat. <i>ascia</i> (fr.
		<i>*acsia</i>).)</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
